## Bible Routes

| Method | Path | Contract |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `GET` | `/api/bible/kjv/books` | Canonically ordered 66-book catalog plus translation history, language, repository/verification provenance, years, corpus counts, source commit, and text/rendering fingerprints |
| `GET` | `/api/bible/kjv/books/{book}` | One complete book plus aligned paragraph, added-word, and words-of-Christ marker DTOs by canonical slug/title or normalized alias; unknown books return `404` |

The Bible domain has no database or remote runtime dependency. Its source is
vendored from `renniemaharaj/kjv-bible` commit
`88723a44bb3e3f229a34f9cf11ce1b7acf971eee`. The metadata records first
publication in 1611, 1769 as the general editorial basis, and a 2026-07-30
verse-level verification reference to Bible SuperSearch KJV module 6.2.0. That
reference is not represented as the repository corpus origin or independent
bibliographical certification.

